ormance"}], "description": "Units organize learning over time so students build understanding rather than experience disconnected lessons."}, {"id": "16625b85-a902-48b5-b21d-4faaa6552c4a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Lesson Design", "children": [{"id": "b420daa7-1db1-4f9f-90fd-75eda73413d2", "type": "concept", "title": "Launch"}, {"id": "d5f37e87-fc0f-4c54-9af4-4b6621aac05f", "type": "concept", "title": "Modeling"}, {"id": "b0863a18-3a79-49a2-8b4d-22a00ebb13ab", "type": "concept", "title": "Guided practice"}, {"id": "3d248b72-814b-4d77-872e-e8d66ec5ab2e", "type": "concept", "title": "Closure"}], "description": "Lessons translate unit goals into daily experiences with purpose, practice, and evidence."}, {"id": "b0bb4df3-f76a-401d-b0ee-607e76d1af0b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Learning Experiences", "children": [{"id": "9df900aa-a3ef-446a-9392-e01294bfe745", "type": "concept", "title": "Inquiry"}, {"id": "86900b16-ca02-4e18-a0d8-207e0a3cbc4a", "type": "concept", "title": "Collaborative learning"}, {"id": "c78810ee-779b-4e6a-b59f-613ee1a5220d", "type": "concept", "title": "Practice and feedback"}, {"id": "ec52d67b-f3b7-4252-90cb-94558a246fa5", "type": "concept", "title": "Metacognition"}], "description": "High-quality experiences engage students in thinking, discourse, creation, and reflection."}]}, {"id": "da4abd83-6832-424b-bd11-1fa68c28dd09", "type": "topic", "title": "Differentiation, Universal Design for Learning, and Inclusive Curriculum", "description": "Plan curriculum and assessment so diverse learners can access, engage with, and demonstrate learning.", "children": [{"id": "ca9e5078-d473-42f1-aea9-6b07c83f7f1d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Differentiation", "children": [{"id": "eb4d78b3-1dbd-4e4c-96c0-44f171597d16", "type": "concept", "title": "Readiness"}, {"id": "437bb616-c6a2-47b6-b440-e2e50d8f85a2", "type": "concept", "title": "Interest"}, {"id": "b9827001-9174-42a3-94f6-6041297ea0d3", "type": "concept", "title": "Learner profile"}, {"id": "6e9d235