"Build fair grading and reporting practices that communicate progress, achievement, and next steps.", "children": [{"id": "305dce92-9c81-4f77-a7c4-83d600366bd4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Grading Practices", "children": [{"id": "1d89ee5c-28a0-4a45-96e1-1abcc0983760", "type": "concept", "title": "Standards-based grading"}, {"id": "973aae35-f2aa-4ca5-9ebd-9b4987fb1ac6", "type": "concept", "title": "Retakes and reassessment"}, {"id": "99077c4f-c0d1-4ee2-9f18-873c9ad0b10c", "type": "concept", "title": "Homework and practice"}, {"id": "61b789d0-15fe-411e-983e-87d532e47cf1", "type": "concept", "title": "Grade validity"}], "description": "Grading should communicate achievement and growth without confusing behavior, compliance, and learning."}, {"id": "a6804274-1008-4f64-a8f2-38d2918ead52", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Reporting to Families", "children": [{"id": "5d738568-f8f7-44e0-96df-259667caf5da", "type": "concept", "title": "Progress reports"}, {"id": "cbeca409-e370-4c11-8027-cbec47a4f3ca", "type": "concept", "title": "Narrative comments"}, {"id": "4ef37231-0c69-4107-abf4-f9fd62b1e599", "type": "concept", "title": "Conferences"}, {"id": "78a6935b-4d77-40f5-9569-53a17441a63f", "type": "concept", "title": "Family-friendly language"}], "description": "Reporting translates evidence into clear information about progress, strengths, and next steps."}, {"id": "e347367c-bda8-40b3-9b8f-dc496d22278b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Portfolios and Reflection", "children": [{"id": "96cc98ef-4a8c-4f1e-9622-f9ee1136e045", "type": "concept", "title": "Selection"}, {"id": "9cf1157f-b10e-4a28-834d-0f5311f6f5cc", "type": "concept", "title": "Reflection"}, {"id": "5b93610f-4229-47fa-bd73-8bab5373497d", "type": "concept", "title": "Evidence of growth"}, {"id": "8b2fa555-bf13-425b-9283-86bf987a2f36", "type": "concept", "title": "Student-led conferences"}], "description": "Portfolios make growth visible and help students explain their learning over time."}]}, {"id": "8c42ad38-ddf2-4bde-